          {
            "title": "Question: Save in variable",
            "id": 82872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa contiene la variabile <code>orders</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\", 3, 1, 2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un numero</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[3, 1, 2, \"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"Jess\", \"Mike\", \"Lynn\", 3, 1, 2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo la creazione di <code>orders</code>, che cosa restituisce <code>orders[3]</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"customers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lynn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"order_number = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"orders = customers + order_number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(orders)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['Jess', 'Mike', 'Lynn', 3, 1, 2]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Lynn\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un errore perché l'indice <code>3</code> appartiene alla seconda lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Save in variable",
            "id": 82876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Unisci le due liste in modo che <code>day_1</code> venga prima e salva il risultato nella variabile <code>overview</code> per usarlo in seguito.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"day_1 = [\" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"day_2 = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"overview = day_1 + day_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(overview)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>overview</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>day_1</code>, <code>+</code>, <code>day_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza l'elenco unito in <code>overview</code> affinché il codice stampi <code>[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"day_1 = [\" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"day_2 = [\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"overview = day_1 + day_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(overview)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"day_1[0]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[3.5, 2, 4, 7, 1]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>overview</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>day_1</code>, <code>+</code> e infine <code>day_2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"code = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(code.count(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[3, 0, 2, 2, 0, 1, 0]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La console qui sotto mostra il risultato per la lista così com'è scritta.</p><p>Se venisse aggiunto un altro <code>0</code> a <code>code</code> prima dell'esecuzione della riga <code>print</code>, che cosa visualizzerebbe invece?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"code = [\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(code.count(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, perché <code>count()</code> usa la lista originale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>8</code>, perché <code>count()</code> restituisce la lunghezza della lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element to count",
            "id": 82880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors.count())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tra le parentesi di <code>count()</code> dovrebbe esserci un valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato in questo codice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La lista è troppo lunga</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tra le parentesi di <code>count()</code> dovrebbe esserci un valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il metodo <code>count()</code> richiede tra parentesi il valore che vogliamo contare.</p><p>Quale riga visualizza quante volte compare <code>\"vanilla\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(flavors.count())\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(flavors.count(\"vanilla\"))</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(flavors.count())</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(flavors.count[\"vanilla\"])</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(flavors.count(\"vanilla\"))</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Boolean",
            "id": 88419,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"schedule = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" schedule)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se entrambi i valori <code>\"ballet\"</code> vengono rimossi prima della verifica dell'appartenenza, che cosa viene visualizzato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"schedule = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;swimming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;running&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ballet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" schedule)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code>, perché l'appartenenza restituisce il numero di corrispondenze</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un errore perché il valore cercato è assente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Reusing",
            "id": 82883,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa fa questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vanilla = flavors.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vanilla)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Salva il numero di elementi <code>\"vanilla\"</code> in una variabile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Crea una copia di <code>flavors</code> e la salva in una variabile</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, il codice è errato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Salva il numero di elementi <code>\"vanilla\"</code> in una variabile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se un valore <code>\"vanilla\"</code> diventa <code>\"chocolate\"</code> prima dell'assegnazione, che cosa memorizza <code>vanilla</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"flavors = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;strawberry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"vanilla = flavors.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;vanilla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(vanilla)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, perché la variabile memorizza il conteggio originale</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Una copia della lista <code>flavors</code> aggiornata</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
